# Copy to `.env` (gitignored) for local development.
# Points at an Obsidian vault config folder so `npm run dev` copies the plugin there.
# Path is relative to the repository root (or absolute).
#
# This project copies only — it does NOT auto-launch Obsidian (owned CDP launch
# hits a Trust-author dialog loop). Open the vault yourself once, trust it,
# install Hot Reload, and enable lantai.
OBSIDIAN_CONFIG_FOLDER=demo-vault/.obsidian
